y2-gpu-check [--seconds 1..300] [--fps 1..60] [--static]
Native 480x360 Lima/GBM/EGL/GLES2 qualification. Default 20s/30fps.
--static draws once, then sleeps; SIGUSR1 requests one redraw.
SIGINT/SIGTERM restores KMS and exits. No software renderer accepted.
Duration/FPS outside bounded range
PASS_ARM_GRAPHICS_ABI_AND_BOUNDED_ARGUMENTS
